ttsandsttp (1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cloud providers (Alibaba Cloud Model Studio / DashScope "Qwen")
    - Opt-in cloud Speech-to-Text (qwen3-asr-flash) via [stt] provider
    - Opt-in cloud Text-to-Speech (qwen3-tts-flash) with voice selection
    - New [api] section: region presets (singapore/beijing/custom),
      configurable base URL and key handling
  * Secure API key storage: systemd credentials, freedesktop Secret
    Service keyring, 0600 file, or env; keys are never stored in config
  * New CLI: set-key, del-key, voices, bench-stt (local vs cloud A/B)
  * Bundled Qwen-TTS voice catalogue and `voices` command
  * Local (sherpa) remains the default and works fully offline

 -- digit1024 <digit1024@example.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 21:37:10 +0200
